	(text "LUCHTMETER S3 v1.0 - ESP32-S3 air-quality meter with 2.8in touchscreen, battery powered (generated by tools/build_sch.py from tools/design.py)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 552 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ad25fe6-cb0c-5fe4-89d3-fbd514958445")
	)
	(text "Sensors on I2C (SDA IO1, SCL IO2): SCD41 CO2 0x62, SHT45 temp/RH 0x44, LTR-303ALS light 0x29 (INT IO41). Qwiic for extra sensors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77619391-5ebd-5201-9139-04703776e621")
	)
	(text "Display MSP2807 (ILI9341): SCK IO12, MOSI IO11, MISO IO13, CS IO10, DC IO9, RST IO14, backlight IO21 (active low). Touch XPT2046: CLK IO7, DIN IO6, DO IO5, CS IO47, IRQ IO48."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 560 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1021a1c6-c7c9-5cd1-8da0-056a6732dca0")
	)
	(text "Power: USB-C -> BQ24075 (charge ~0.9 A, power path) -> 18650 on BAT+/BAT- (DW01A protection) -> XC6220 3.3 V. 3V3_SW (display + sensors) on when PWR_EN (IO18) is low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 564 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cf93f05f-b3b7-52dc-a002-3b627506933c")
	)
	(text "Deep sleep: set PWR_EN high (rail off), set all display/I2C pins to input, wake on timer or the WEKKEN button (IO4, ext0). Battery: VBAT = ADC(IO8) x 2. CHG IO15, PGOOD IO16 (low = USB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 568 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "68bdbde8-aa8f-5fc6-a0b5-f4d389f8f2ba")
	)
